13 1 7 12
14 1 8 13
15 1 9 14
16 1 10 14
17 1 11 14
18 1 12 14
19 1 13 14
20 1 14 14
21 1 15 14
22 1 16 14
23 1 17 14
24 1 6 5
25 1 8 7
26 1 18 25
27 1 19 25
28 1 20 25

# Extension specification for digital output and input triggers:
# id type channel delay (us) duration (us)
extension TRIGGERS 2
1 1 3 0 10

# Extension specification for setting labels:
# id set labelstring
extension LABELSET 1
1 1 PMC
2 0 PMC
3 0 LIN
4 0 AVG
5 0 REP
6 0 SLC
7 0 PAR
8 0 NAV
9 1 AVG
10 2 AVG
11 3 AVG
12 4 AVG
13 5 AVG
14 6 AVG
15 7 AVG
16 8 AVG
17 9 AVG
18 1 PAR
19 2 PAR
20 3 PAR

# Extension specification for increasing labels:
# id set labelstring
extension LABELINC 3
1 1 LIN

